   "source": [
    "# 图 2.3\n",
    "\n",
    "![2.3.png](attachment:2.3.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "42fd9474",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7ffa1a54",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 背景信息 "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e7321b6e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "再次回顾 $h(x)=\\frac{\\sin(10\\pi x)}{1+64(x-.25)}+x^{2},x\\in[0,1]$.取区间 $[0,1]$ 内 $n = 10$ 个等距采样点构成设计 $D$,即 $D=\\{(i-1)/(n-1)\\}_{i=1}^{n}$.假设选用 Gauss 函数 $R(\\boldsymbol{x})=\\exp(-\\|\\boldsymbol{x}\\|^{2}/\\theta^{2})$ 作为径向基函数.图 2.3 展示了三组不同 $\\theta$ 取值对应的径向基函数插值结果.可以观察到:当 $\\theta = 0.1$ 时,径向基函数插值效果优异;$\\theta = 1$ 时插值效果较差(与图 2.1 左图情形相近);$\\theta = 0.01$ 时插值结果严重失真.综上,径向基函数插值具备极强的灵活性,能够实现高精度拟合,但随之带来额外的调参工作量,需要合理优化径向基函数中的长度尺度参数."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "673a1992",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b96573ce",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 指令"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "22451bae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "设置画布宽 15 英寸,高 5 英寸,将画布分为 1x3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fd2fa87c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=15,repr.plot.height=5)\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,3))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eb9d8933",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "定义函数\n",
    "\n",
    "$$f(x):=\\frac{\\sin(10\\pi x)}{1+64(x-.25)}+x^{2},$$\n",
    "\n",
    "创建 $[0,1]$ 上的 301 个点,计算真实的函数值:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1799e811",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "f=function(x) sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.25)^2)+x^2\n",
    "test=seq(0,1,length=301)\n",
    "true=f(test)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c4a5aa9d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在 $[0,1]$ 上等距取 10 个点作为拟合节点,计算其函数值:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "acba16bf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "n=10\n",
    "D=((1:n)-1)/(n-1)\n",
    "y=f(D)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4c0ce2e6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "计算距离矩阵 $\\|\\boldsymbol{x}\\|$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3ab3038c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "E=abs(outer(D,D,\"-\"))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "92ab7a44",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. 左图:令参数 $\\theta=0.01$,计算矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{R}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "530caf58",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "theta=.01\n",
    "R=exp(-(E/theta)^2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6d580e77",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "利用公式 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}=\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}$ 求解 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$,利用公式 $\\widehat{y}(x)=\\boldsymbol{r}(x)'\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$ 求解插值函数:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c4e4283e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "coef=solve(R,y)\n",
    "R_pred=exp(-(outer(test,D,\"-\")/theta)^2)\n",
    "pred=R_pred%*%coef \n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5007e459",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "开始作图:创建画布绘制真实函数图像,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 曲线类型为光滑曲线;\n",
    "- 曲线线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 曲线类型为虚线;\n",
    "- $x$ 轴上的标识为 `x`,$y$ 轴上的标识为 `y`;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴的显示范围为 $[\\min(y)-.25,\\max(y)+.25]$;\n",
    "- 主标题为"$\\theta=0.01$";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放参数为 2;\n",
    "\n",
    "叠加拟合节点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 节点类型为实心圆点;\n",
    "- 节点缩放参数为 2;\n",
    "- 节点颜色为蓝色;\n",
    "\n",
    "叠加拟合函数图像,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 曲线颜色为绿色;\n",
    "- 曲线线宽为 3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a5a8fdf1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(test,true,type=\"l\",lwd=3,lty=2,xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=expression(theta==0.01),cex.main=2)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "lines(test,pred,col=3,lwd=3)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1b52eefe",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "2. 中图:令参数 $\\theta=0.1$,计算矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{R}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d9614122",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "theta=.1\n",
    "R=exp(-(E/theta)^2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cbc0e224",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "利用公式 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}=\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}$ 求解 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$,利用公式 $\\widehat{y}(x)=\\boldsymbol{r}(x)'\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$ 求解插值函数:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aa4dad8a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "coef=solve(R,y)\n",
    "R_pred=exp(-(outer(test,D,\"-\")/theta)^2)\n",
    "pred=R_pred%*%coef \n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6382b339",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "开始作图:创建画布绘制真实函数图像,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 曲线类型为光滑曲线;\n",
    "- 曲线线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 曲线类型为虚线;\n",
    "- $x$ 轴上的标识为 `x`,$y$ 轴上的标识为 `y`;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴的显示范围为 $[\\min(y)-.25,\\max(y)+.25]$;\n",
    "- 主标题为"$\\theta=0.01$";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放参数为 2;\n",
    "\n",
    "叠加拟合节点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 节点类型为实心圆点;\n",
    "- 节点缩放参数为 2;\n",
    "- 节点颜色为蓝色;\n",
    "\n",
    "叠加拟合函数图像,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 曲线颜色为绿色;\n",
    "- 曲线线宽为 3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "25bcf60f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(test,true,type=\"l\",lwd=3,lty=2,xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=expression(theta==0.01),cex.main=2)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "lines(test,pred,col=3,lwd=3)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b36a1199",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "3. 右图:令参数 $\\theta=1$,计算矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{R}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "57f16b4a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "theta=1\n",
